-- Paket ABT "abt-prodeo-panggilan-29okt" (29 Okt 2026): perkara prodeo (amar tanpa nominal, rincian Rp0,00 (nihil)) dan tanggal panggilan sebanyak relaas.
-- PRASYARAT (baca saja) "A|B|C|D|E": A = nomor 11120-11199 yang sudah ada tetapi isinya bukan isi paket (harus 0) | B = nomor baru yang sudah persis isi paket | C = variabel 8508/8547/8600 berisi LAMA | D = berisi BARU | E = fungsi isian_rtf_tanggal ada (1).
-- Benar: "0|0|3|0|1" (pasang pertama) atau "0|29|0|3|1" (pasang ulang). Selain itu berhenti, tidak ada yang diubah.
SELECT CONCAT_WS('|',
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM aps_badilag.abt_variabel v WHERE v.no_var BETWEEN 11120 AND 11199 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM (SELECT 11120 AS n, '2479fefd72fd69fdcd5ec10f596a9049' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11121 AS n, 'b4abbec87269eadec502028eb86aaab4' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11122 AS n, '30ed82ee11fe06b0126e5ad0e93ccec6' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11123 AS n, 'a31aaeec9a044b6ba3813507fceffd3d' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11124 AS n, '996c08563de7a2e84db7e42745042c62' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11130 AS n, '22f1be07e1102fa4419fc1d35457238b' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11131 AS n, 'dcddc7006b491c3ad9c3ade898f13660' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11132 AS n, 'ad51fef1a173380cf252fbbb8f219b8e' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11133 AS n, 'b8e62e4fb76a97c667c93c08e7edfc93' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11134 AS n, '76fbc1b01ac20e9b44487c397c3baefa' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11135 AS n, '3e7638bf45c30cd63e8150df20a39627' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11136 AS n, '91e297475af62c35e5d0418d2cb8a1d9' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11137 AS n, 'bae2e5db81c7d10a062cd83140edd2ce' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11138 AS n, '1ac60c406af44c0aa06aed2404d29462' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11139 AS n, '978a101c95b344d026ee6269d149f834' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11140 AS n, '5c9e25536545be9fe83a08d0bd6a50f5' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11141 AS n, 'dcf36519bd2bc62b1c393afea7a280ce' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11142 AS n, '56767a3d368afe0ef452f85e6c597eba' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11143 AS n, '7e328670cf21ec83c542da33a5655131' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11150 AS n, 'ed26135329f52befa22c63281f78a6bd' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11151 AS n, '97f34285b067004b0460f784721d4fb6' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11152 AS n, 'f07e554a88726cf068739ea57bb2a314' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11153 AS n, '2b7188e8b4a55d45e4460767cdc5c4d0' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11154 AS n, '182abba84b099fd81cec997dc7cc91ee' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11155 AS n, 'df236e7c196da20843ba46229bcd0943' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11156 AS n, '67f9482d8d662a818268d49e9fbb5720' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11157 AS n, '384056a4f487ddd98d234a0e958f5a75' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11158 AS n, '4869b827ec4a243823999dcf003ff5e6' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11159 AS n, '62bea5f33c00f9d4d19c7d7e3b684a6e' AS h) d WHERE d.n = v.no_var AND d.h = MD5(CONCAT_WS('|', v.nama, v.data_type, IFNULL(v.sql_query, ''), v.locked)))),
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM aps_badilag.abt_variabel v JOIN (SELECT 11120 AS n, '2479fefd72fd69fdcd5ec10f596a9049' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11121 AS n, 'b4abbec87269eadec502028eb86aaab4' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11122 AS n, '30ed82ee11fe06b0126e5ad0e93ccec6' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11123 AS n, 'a31aaeec9a044b6ba3813507fceffd3d' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11124 AS n, '996c08563de7a2e84db7e42745042c62' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11130 AS n, '22f1be07e1102fa4419fc1d35457238b' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11131 AS n, 'dcddc7006b491c3ad9c3ade898f13660' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11132 AS n, 'ad51fef1a173380cf252fbbb8f219b8e' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11133 AS n, 'b8e62e4fb76a97c667c93c08e7edfc93' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11134 AS n, '76fbc1b01ac20e9b44487c397c3baefa' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11135 AS n, '3e7638bf45c30cd63e8150df20a39627' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11136 AS n, '91e297475af62c35e5d0418d2cb8a1d9' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11137 AS n, 'bae2e5db81c7d10a062cd83140edd2ce' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11138 AS n, '1ac60c406af44c0aa06aed2404d29462' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11139 AS n, '978a101c95b344d026ee6269d149f834' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11140 AS n, '5c9e25536545be9fe83a08d0bd6a50f5' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11141 AS n, 'dcf36519bd2bc62b1c393afea7a280ce' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11142 AS n, '56767a3d368afe0ef452f85e6c597eba' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11143 AS n, '7e328670cf21ec83c542da33a5655131' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11150 AS n, 'ed26135329f52befa22c63281f78a6bd' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11151 AS n, '97f34285b067004b0460f784721d4fb6' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11152 AS n, 'f07e554a88726cf068739ea57bb2a314' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11153 AS n, '2b7188e8b4a55d45e4460767cdc5c4d0' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11154 AS n, '182abba84b099fd81cec997dc7cc91ee' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11155 AS n, 'df236e7c196da20843ba46229bcd0943' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11156 AS n, '67f9482d8d662a818268d49e9fbb5720' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11157 AS n, '384056a4f487ddd98d234a0e958f5a75' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11158 AS n, '4869b827ec4a243823999dcf003ff5e6' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 11159 AS n, '62bea5f33c00f9d4d19c7d7e3b684a6e' AS h) d ON d.n = v.no_var AND d.h = MD5(CONCAT_WS('|', v.nama, v.data_type, IFNULL(v.sql_query, ''), v.locked))),
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM aps_badilag.abt_variabel v JOIN (SELECT 8508 AS n, '0edc755e42fca50aebddddad2bb5c4df' AS l, '992457b4808306e64c7579c8b33b8980' AS b UNION ALL SELECT 8547 AS n, '2f2045c75c267016272bdff0589772c8' AS l, '36ec8016393bd4730d7a97f80ac3d362' AS b UNION ALL SELECT 8600 AS n, 'b7e1c2b80ef5d8e62ad611e4231a7127' AS l, 'ea1127b4272cbe0a8fc27dbf79e11bdf' AS b) d ON d.n = v.no_var AND MD5(v.sql_query) = d.l),
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM aps_badilag.abt_variabel v JOIN (SELECT 8508 AS n, '0edc755e42fca50aebddddad2bb5c4df' AS l, '992457b4808306e64c7579c8b33b8980' AS b UNION ALL SELECT 8547 AS n, '2f2045c75c267016272bdff0589772c8' AS l, '36ec8016393bd4730d7a97f80ac3d362' AS b UNION ALL SELECT 8600 AS n, 'b7e1c2b80ef5d8e62ad611e4231a7127' AS l, 'ea1127b4272cbe0a8fc27dbf79e11bdf' AS b) d ON d.n = v.no_var AND MD5(v.sql_query) = d.b),
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.routines WHERE routine_schema = DATABASE() AND routine_name = 'isian_rtf_tanggal')) AS prasyarat;

